# M12 "Yetenek Yolları", flow "skills_mage" run 1 (needs the PostgreSQL test database): creates
# the Kargan mage "Kozcu" and quits at the character list. run-ui-flows.ps1 then raises it to level 10 (9 unspent
# skill points) with vo_admin set-level, in the flow's own vo_it_* schema of vedatonline_test.
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m12_mag
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charcreate+race+idle 900
clickon create.race.kargan
clickon create.next
waitfor charcreate+details 60
clickon create.class.3
clickon create.name
text Kozcu
clickon create.submit
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
quit